{"id":1393,"level":64,"name":"Захист: хід фігурою (1)","group":"Захист","format":27,"description":"If one of your pieces is under attack, you have a problem.<br />You don&rsquo;t want to lose your piece.<br />So you need to do something to defend it.<br />One way to defend is by moving your piece. <p>Have a look at the example.<br />The knight is under attack from the rook.<br />It can move to two squares.<br />But only the green square is safe!<br />On the red square, the rook can take the knight as well!<br />Always make sure you flee to a safe square.</p> <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Defend your piece by moving it.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":9,"examples":[{"fen":"8/3k4/8/8/3K4/8/r7/N7 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gb3,Rc2][%cal Ga2c2]} 1. Nb3 *","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":56730,"fen":"8/4k3/8/4K3/8/8/5r1N/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gf2h2]} {Q=1} 1. Ng4 *","format":27,"texts":["Збережіть свого коня."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56723,"fen":"4k1n1/p7/8/3pp3/8/5N2/5K2/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{Q=1} 1... e4 *","format":27,"texts":["Не втрачайте пішака."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56728,"fen":"5kr1/6p1/6K1/3B4/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{Q=1} 1... Rh8 *","format":27,"texts":["Збережи свою туру."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56724,"fen":"k7/q1p5/ppN5/8/8/2B5/1K6/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{Q=1} 1... Qb7 *","format":27,"texts":["Збережи свого ферзя."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":57516,"fen":"8/8/8/8/3b4/6k1/6P1/5KR1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gd4g1]} {Q=1} 1. Rh1 *","format":27,"texts":["Збережи свою туру."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56725,"fen":"nR6/4k3/8/8/8/8/8/1K6 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{Q=1} 1... Nc7 *","format":27,"texts":["Перемістіть свого коня в безпечне місце."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":56726,"fen":"8/6k1/8/8/2K5/8/r7/N7 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Ga2a1]} {Q=1} 1. Nb3 *","format":27,"texts":["Збережіть свого коня."],"text":"","isMult